1
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:54,000
Miami Magma is a science fiction, action, tv movie
film directed by Todor Chapkanov.

2
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:42,000
Antoinette Vitrini, a volcanologist, confirms her theory of a long-dormant
underground volcano after an offshore-drilling rig bursts into flames.

3
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Now, she must stop catastrophic amounts of magma from
pumping out right under Miami, Florida.

4
